This distribution is a fork (branch "my-mods") derived from File Browser
v2.62.2. To keep the changes auditable, the Go module path is unchanged
(github.com/filebrowser/filebrowser/v2); branch "master" tracks the pristine
upstream and "my-mods" carries the modifications below.

Primary modifications introduced by this fork (LumenBrowser):

  * Public documentation portal (/docs) — an anonymous, read-only web portal
    over the server root, with a directory tree, Markdown rendering, code
    highlighting and drawio diagram preview, served as a self-contained page
    embedded in the binary.

  * Anonymous drop box (POST /api/public/upload) — a login-free upload
    endpoint that stores files under /uploads/ and returns a permanent share
    link.

  * Enhanced share pages — inline Markdown / text preview with syntax
    highlighting and an improved password-share flow, instead of
    download-only sharing.

  * Security hardening — increased share-hash entropy (24-byte, base64-url)
    for both authenticated shares and drop-box shares, sensitive-file
    filtering in the documentation portal, and related CSP adjustments.

  * lumen CLI client — an independent, dependency-light Go module
    (github.com/socake/filebrowser-mods/client) that wraps the existing REST
    API for scripting, CI and batch workflows.

